      "공식 출처: https://nc-golf.co.kr/Course/View.aspx 및 https://nc-golf.co.kr/Course/Strategy.aspx (각 홀 상세: https://nc-golf.co.kr/Course/Hole/01.aspx ~ /09.aspx, 2026-10-12 확인)."
